          }
        ],
        "text": "This house and the management company absolutely exceeded our expectations. Rain Lily Ln was not only beautiful but also incredibly comfortable. The layout was ideal for our group of 14 — the bedroom configuration worked perfectly, and every bed was super comfortable (which is rare to find in a rental!). Everything was clean, well-stocked, and exactly as described. From start to finish, our experience was seamless. We can’t wait to come back!",
